{
  "_readme": "The single source of truth for every word list and pattern used to turn a job posting into numbers. ghostjob/features.py (training) and web/features.js (the live site) BOTH read this file, so the two can never drift apart. Regexes here must be valid in Python AND JavaScript: stick to \\b, \\d, \\s, character classes, alternation and non-capturing groups (?:...). Do not use lookbehind or named groups, which differ between the two languages.",
